{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43336","headline":"临川羡鱼 · 薛少殷","name":"临川羡鱼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾是归家客，今年且未旋。\n游鳞方有待，织网岂能捐。\n向水烟波夕，吟风岁月迁。\n莓苔生古岸，葭菼变清川。\n不逐沧波叟，还宗内外篇。\n良辰难自掷，此日愿忘筌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛少殷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43336.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43336","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}